## 8. Compliance

| ID | Requirement | Testable Criterion | Status (2026-07-06) |
|----|-------------|-------------------|---------------------|
| CXC-BIND-C1 | Attribute binding | A namespace change updates the bound attribute within one frame | PASS — opacity/rotation/scale/color/value/text; bare-namespace + object forms; wire-time current value applies |
| CXC-BIND-C2 | Red Alert | An Image with `visible` bound + a `blink` behavior toggles at the declared period; golden-pinned at both phases | PASS — goldens `bind_red_alert_on`/`_off`; live loop measured 500ms half-periods for period_ms 1000; demo `render/examples/red_alert.compose.yaml` |
| CXC-BIND-C3 | Dradis sweep | A widget with a `rotate` behavior on `rotation`, triggered by a `scanning` state, sweeps at the declared deg/s | PASS — 90 deg/s: 45° @0.5s, 90° @1s, wraps mod 360; goldens `bind_dradis_idle`/`_mid_sweep`; demo `render/examples/dradis.compose.yaml` |
| CXC-BIND-C4 | Variable substitution | `$var` resolves at parse time; a namespace-bound variable stays reactive | PASS — incl. widget-scoped blocks, embedded strings, unknown-`$` literals |
| CXC-BIND-C5 | Revert on release | When a trigger goes false, the target reverts to its base value | PASS — continuous + one-shot; revert lands on the LIVE bound base (notify_base_change) |
| CXC-BIND-C6 | Cross-platform identity | Behavior output is pixel-identical macOS↔RPi at sampled frames (deterministic clock) | PASS — 6 sampled frames (both demos, incl. rotated AA) SHA-256-identical macOS arm64 ↔ RPi5 aarch64; render_frame_at is the sampling mode; suite green both platforms |
| CXC-BIND-C7 | No code path | A config with an inline-code field is rejected/ignored, not executed | PASS — canary payload never executes; fields stripped + warned; code-only `do:` dropped |
| CXC-BIND-C8 | Value map | A literal `map:` translates a state to a value; arithmetic maps are refused (DSL boundary) | PASS — color map by state; templated map refused with warning, binding dropped |
| CXC-BIND-C9 | State selection | A bus-state flip drives a widget through its matched transition; an attr no rule covers snaps; goldens pinned at rest + mid-transition | PASS (2026-08-04) — [CXC-BIND-STATES]/[CXC-BIND-TRANSITION]; selector map/expr/bare forms; unset default falls to first state |
| CXC-BIND-C10 | Transition determinism | A tween is SHA-256-identical macOS↔RPi5 at sampled `render_frame_at(t)` frames; `cubic-bezier` matches the Lottie solver bit-for-bit; damage confined to the animating widget's bounds | PASS (2026-08-04) — deferred first-tick start-stamp; `bezier_ease` reused; `last_touched` → `_damage_widgets` |
| CXC-BIND-C11 | Literal-only states | A `states:`/`state:` config carrying an inline-code/arithmetic field is refused, never executed | PASS (2026-08-04) — `strip_code_fields` + `validate_map` on every state map ([CXC-BIND-BOUNDARY]) |

